flowchart LR
    SYM["symbolic verdict"] --> CAND{"candidate?<br/>Vulnerable · Unknown ·<br/>Protected SYM-05"}
    CAND -->|no| KEEP0["final = symbolic"]
    CAND -->|yes| SL["label-free IR slice<br/>(no comments, no verdicts)"]
